<section id="services">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <div class="sec-idx rv">01</div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="rv d1">What we build.</h2>
        <p class="lead rv d2">From concept sketches through to the last coat of paint, we take ownership of the build so no detail falls between trades.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="svc-row rv"><span class="svc-n">01</span><div class="svc-body"><h3>New home builds</h3><p>Bespoke new homes made to your specifications — single or double-storey, on acreage or an urban block.</p></div><span class="svc-arrow">&#8599;</span></div>
      <div class="svc-row rv"><span class="svc-n">02</span><div class="svc-body"><h3>Renovations & extensions</h3><p>Extra rooms, kitchen and bathroom renovations, granny flats, and second-storey extensions.</p></div><span class="svc-arrow">&#8599;</span></div>
      <div class="svc-row rv"><span class="svc-n">03</span><div class="svc-body"><h3>Decks & outdoor living</h3><p>Timber and composite decks, alfresco zones, verandahs, and undercover entertaining areas.</p></div><span class="svc-arrow">&#8599;</span></div>
      <div class="svc-row rv"><span class="svc-n">04</span><div class="svc-body"><h3>Structural repairs & maintenance</h3><p>Foundation fixes, wall crack repairs, roof structure repairs, and general building maintenance.</p></div><span class="svc-arrow">&#8599;</span></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="statement" id="builders">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div>
      <h2 class="rv">Homeowner <span class="acc">projects</span></h2>
      <p class="rv d1" style="margin-top:22px;">We work directly with homeowners across Sydney — one licensed builder, one point of contact.</p>
      <div class="btn-row rv d2">
        <a href="#quote" class="btn btn-acc">Request a quote</a>
        <a href="#process" class="btn btn-ghost">See how a build runs</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="sub-pts">
      <div class="sub-pt rv"><div class="tick">&#10003;</div><div><b>Design & approval</b><span>Concept plans, working drawings, DA or CDC lodgement — handled in-house.</span></div></div>
      <div class="sub-pt rv d1"><div class="tick">&#10003;</div><div><b>Construction</b><span>Your build managed start to finish by a licensed builder who is on site every day.</span></div></div>
      <div class="sub-pt rv d2"><div class="tick">&#10003;</div><div><b>Handover</b><span>Final inspection, defect period and after-care — we do not disappear when the keys are handed over.</span></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

