<section class="process" id="process">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sticky">
      <div class="sec-head" style="margin-bottom:30px;">
        <div class="sec-idx rv">03</div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="rv d1">How a build runs.</h2>
          <p class="lead rv d2">Four steps, zero surprises.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="step rv"><span class="step-n">01</span><div><h3>Consultation & design</h3><p>We hear what you need, provide design guidance, and prepare a scope of works.</p></div></div>
      <div class="step rv"><span class="step-n">02</span><div><h3>Firm quote</h3><p>A written quote outlining what is included, what is excluded, and a practical timeline.</p></div></div>
      <div class="step rv"><span class="step-n">03</span><div><h3>Construction</h3><p>Your build is managed from excavation through to handover — one point of contact, with no passing the buck.</p></div></div>
      <div class="step rv"><span class="step-n">04</span><div><h3>Handover & aftercare</h3><p>A closing walk-through, documentation, and support after completion.</p></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="quote" id="quote">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="side">
      <h2 class="rv">Get a firm price for your project.</h2>
      <div class="q-lines">
        <div class="q-line rv d1"><b>Area served</b><span style="font-size:19px;font-weight:800;">Sydney metro</span><span>From the CBD to Parramatta, Liverpool, Penrith, Campbelltown, Chatswood and Hornsby.</span></div>
        <div class="q-line rv d2"><b>Quotes</b><span style="font-size:19px;font-weight:800;">Free &amp; no-obligation</span><span>Tell us about the job and we&rsquo;ll come back with a firm written quote.</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="rv d3" style="margin-top:26px;"><a href="#lbq" class="btn btn-acc">Request a quote</a></div>
    </div>
