      <p style="color:var(--ink2);font-size:15.5px;margin-bottom:22px;">Share a few details about the project and we&rsquo;ll reply with a free written quote &mdash; no obligation.</p>
      <a href="#lbq" class="btn btn-acc">Go to the quote form</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="faq">
  <div class="wrap faq-wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <div class="sec-idx rv">04</div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="rv d1">Asked on every project.</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    <details class="faq rv"><summary>How much does a new home build cost?</summary><div class="a">Timelines differ with the size, specification and conditions of your site. Once we've completed a site assessment, you'll receive a fixed written quote &mdash; no unexpected costs.</div></details>
    <details class="faq rv"><summary>Are you licensed and insured?</summary><div class="a">Absolutely &mdash; we&rsquo;re fully licensed and insured. Our licence number and certificate of currency are available whenever you need them.</div></details>
    <details class="faq rv"><summary>Which areas do you cover?</summary><div class="a">We build across the Sydney metro area &mdash; including Sydney CBD, Parramatta, Liverpool, Penrith, Campbelltown, Chatswood and Hornsby.</div></details>
    <details class="faq rv"><summary>How long does a typical build take?</summary><div class="a">For a standard single-storey home, the build from slab through to handover generally runs 6&ndash;9 months, subject to weather, approvals and chosen finishes.</div></details>
  </div>
</section>

